**Basic Information**

A dataset covering 20 energetic materials sampling via active learning with temperature and pressure ranging from 100 K to 4000 K, and 0 to 120 GPa, respectively. The in-distribution (id-) testset was built via running DFT-MD with a different initialization seed from init. training set. The out-of-distribution (ood) testset was built for another 6 energetic materials).

